  "difficulty": "complex",
  "description": "Create a real-photo social launch asset from the farmers market image.",
  "instruction": "Create an 800x600 social launch asset from the real farmers market photo. Complete it as a production workflow: place and crop the photo, apply the final color treatment, add the main information panel, add the accent strip, add the approval badge, add the headline 'LAUNCH CHECK 010', add the detail 'COPY LOCKED 010', add the owner/status line 'OWNER: COMMS', and add the CTA 'QUEUE POST'.",
